-        (Cdiv * (Y + gmAffineFirstPoissonRadius M₁ M₃ Q) ^ epsilon *
-          (2 * gmAffineFirstPoissonRadius M₁ M₃ Q + 3)) *
-        ((32 * M₃ : ℝ) *
-          SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 0 gmAffineLocalBumpDual ^ 2 *
