-        (Y + gmAffineFirstPoissonRadius M₁ M₃ Q) ^ epsilon *
-        SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 0 gmAffineLocalBumpDual ^ 3 * Q ^ 2 *
-        ((2 * gmAffineFirstPoissonRadius M₁ M₃ Q + 3) *
-          (M₃ : ℝ) * (M₂ : ℝ)) * H ≤
